{"type":"text","timestamp":1778375745224,"sessionID":"ses_1f08bb3a9ffepT5c6B0AFj0Tjq","part":{"id":"prt_e0f7456f8001RWeGvAyBQ5KYl7","messageID":"msg_e0f744d2200146jfgjkOxt6W2G","sessionID":"ses_1f08bb3a9ffepT5c6B0AFj0Tjq","type":"text","text":"I’ll inspect the imported issue context and repository guidance first, then make only local ontology edits if the request is actionable. After validation, I’ll commit only the edited files and create the two uncommitted comment files.","time":{"start":1778375743224,"end":1778375745221},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_047f3c3f938c24eb0169ffdc3f2e5c8197b7c54876d47d8d74","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778375745354,"sessionID":"ses_1f08bb3a9ffepT5c6B0AFj0Tjq","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_lQelFNPDLUvBtz8sLUk8zfoV","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json","offset":1,"limit":2000},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"related #2097\\n\\n**tendon cell**\\n\\n- reclassify to 'fibroblast' and 'part of' some 'tendon' \\n- adjust the textual def accordingly\\n\\n**otic fibrocyte**\\n- reclassify from fibrocyte to mesenchymal cell (PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/))\\n- add synonyms - cochlear fibrocyte (PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)) and spiral ligament fibrocyte (PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/)\\n\\n**In a seperate ticket - refine otic fibrobalst and subclasses**\\n1) Currently, otic fibroblast is linked to spiral ligmanet but it encompasses both spiral ligament and spiral limbus - This definition should be relabelled to Cochlear fibrocytes (more widely used) and treated as the general term \\n2) A spiral ligament fibrocyte term should be added and all Type I-V subclasses should be added under it \\n3) More info should be added to the textual defs of the subclasses (especially functions) \\n\\nUseful refs \\n\\n- PMID: 24727668\\n- PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)\\n- PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/) - newer paper\\n- PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/) - newer paper -specific to Spiral ligament fibrocytes\\n\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"remove tendon cell and otic fibrocyte from under fibrocyte\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3239\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"related #2097\\n\\n**tendon cell**\\n\\n- reclassify to 'fibroblast' and 'part of' some 'tendon' \\n- adjust the textual def accordingly\\n\\n**otic fibrocyte**\\n- reclassify from fibrocyte to mesenchymal cell (PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/))\\n- add synonyms - cochlear fibrocyte (PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)) and spiral ligament fibrocyte (PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/)\\n\\n**In a seperate ticket - refine otic fibrobalst and subclasses**\\n1) Currently, otic fibroblast is linked to spiral ligmanet but it encompasses both spiral ligament and spiral limbus - This definition should be relabelled to Cochlear fibrocytes (more widely used) and treated as the general term \\n2) A spiral ligament fibrocyte term should be added and all Type I-V subclasses should be added under it \\n3) More info should be added to the textual defs of the subclasses (especially functions) \\n\\nUseful refs \\n\\n- PMID: 24727668\\n- PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)\\n- PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/) - newer paper\\n- PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/) - newer paper -specific to Spiral ligament fibrocytes\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"remove tendon cell and otic fibrocyte from under fibrocyte\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3239\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778375745325,"end":1778375745351}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_047f3c3f938c24eb0169ffdc412c408197a2ad193b024c3b7c"}},"id":"prt_e0f745ec80012KFcW891WKkk5p","sessionID":"ses_1f08bb3a9ffepT5c6B0AFj0Tjq","messageID":"msg_e0f744d2200146jfgjkOxt6W2G"}}
